      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i normally get these killer migraines where i see weird lights and stuff but this one feels kinda different. my left arm feels really weak and heavy like i cant really grip things right and my vision in my left eye is all blurry. do u think this is just a bad migraine aura or something else??",
